   "resumo_en": "Nós Vamos Invadir sua Praia (transl. We Are Going to Invade Your Beach) is the debut album by the Brazilian rock band Ultraje a Rigor, released in 1985.\nThe sound is a mixture of new wave, punk rock, rockabilly and ska, with humorous subjects. Its title (which translates as  \"We Are Going to Invade Your Beach\") alludes to the fact that they were a band from São Paulo trying to be successful in the coastline city of Rio de Janeiro.\nIn 2010, the album was released in 180 gram Vinyl, by the Record label Polysom.",
